  "description": "A high-performance mediator implementation for .NET 8+ with built-in support for streaming requests, background processing, persistent notifications, and deadlock-safe ConfigureAwait behavior by default. Modern alternative to MediatR with advanced features like IAsyncEnumerable streaming, compiled expressions, aggressive performance optimizations, automatic UI deadlock prevention, and crash-safe persistence. Supports .NET 9 and .NET 10.",
